cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, experimental data, figures or workflows, please
  cite the repository and the specific frozen release used.
title: Pipe Stress Sensing Benchmark & Data Platform
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gao
    given-names: Bin
    affiliation: University of Electronic Science and Technology of China (UESTC)
abstract: >-
  A traceable research platform for real P110 magnetic-strain and 406-mm
  MEM-remanence-eddy-current pull-test data, with reproducible Python and
  MATLAB workflows, explicit quality-control provenance and conservative
  stress-assessment claim limits.
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-08-29
repository-code: https://github.com/dctthree/pipe-stress-data-platform
url: https://github.com/dctthree/pipe-stress-data-platform
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - pipeline inspection
  - pipeline stress assessment
  - magnetic sensing
  - remanence
  - eddy-current testing
  - strain gauge
  - four-point bending
  - reproducible research
